SUMMARY:MG M5 demo (Dusko): Stage 1 release and acceptance
DESCRIPTION:Deliverable: Build 1.5.0 live on Google Play and submitted to t
 he App Store\; listings and screenshots EN and ES\; microphone disclosure\
 ; status notification (no charge). The Stage 1 checklist run on a physical
  phone\, screen recorded (October 28)\, with a pass/fail list.\nAcceptance
 : Your written Stage 1 acceptance after the recording and checklist.\nPaym
 ent: USD 550\, Payment 5\nDependencies: Francisco: written acceptance by O
 ctober 30. Apple: verdict on 1.5.0 (iOS goes live when it arrives).
CATEGORIES:MeetingGuard\,Milestone\,Dusko
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:mg-m6@meetingguard.ai
DTSTAMP:20261027T090000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261110
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261111
SUMMARY:MG M6 demo (Dusko): Outlook calendar\, two-way sync
DESCRIPTION:Deliverable: Connected accounts screen\; Microsoft sign-in\; me
 etings both ways with no duplicates and no loops\; conflict rule (most rec
 ent edit wins\, the loser kept as a visible note for a day)\; recurrence a
 nd exceptions\, time zones\, all-day events\, cancellations\, declined inv
 itations\, token expiry and re-consent\; alerts re-reconcile after every s
 ync\; clear error messages\; 24 hour soak on two phones.\nAcceptance: A me
 eting created in the app appears in Outlook\; an Outlook edit appears in t
 he app\; alarms follow\; no duplicates after the soak.\nPayment: USD 550\,
  Payment 6\nDependencies: Francisco: the Azure app registration by Novembe
 r 3 (steps provided).
CATEGORIES:MeetingGuard\,Milestone\,Dusko
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:mg-m7@meetingguard.ai
DTSTAMP:20261027T090000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261117
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261118
SUMMARY:MG M7 demo (Dusko): Microsoft To Do\, two-way sync
DESCRIPTION:Deliverable: List choice\, always shown before you confirm\; ti
 tle\, notes\, due date\, done state and deletion both ways\; a task comple
 ted in To Do silences its alarm here within a minute\; voice tasks land in
  the chosen list\; "what is due today" includes synced tasks\; the app say
 s when Microsoft lacks something.\nAcceptance: A task created in the app a
 ppears in the chosen list\; completing it in either place syncs within a m
 inute.\nPayment: USD 550\, Payment 7\nDependencies: M6 (the connected-acco
 unts framework).
CATEGORIES:MeetingGuard\,Milestone\,Dusko
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:mg-m8@meetingguard.ai
DTSTAMP:20261027T090000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261124
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261125
SUMMARY:MG M8 demo (Dusko): Google Tasks sync\; the spoken debrief
DESCRIPTION:Deliverable: Google Tasks two-way with the same engine and test
 s (public switch when Google approves the scope\, as agreed). After a meet
 ing\, speak for up to 60 seconds\; the app proposes tasks with owners and 
 due dates linked to the meeting\; you edit and confirm\; nothing saved bef
 ore that. EN and ES.\nAcceptance: A spoken debrief becoming confirmed\, li
 nked tasks with reminders. Google Tasks syncing on a test account.\nPaymen
 t: USD 550\, Payment 8\nDependencies: Google: scope approval for the publi
 c switch (test accounts work at once).
CATEGORIES:MeetingGuard\,Milestone\,Dusko
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:mg-m9@meetingguard.ai
DTSTAMP:20261027T090000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261127
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261128
SUMMARY:MG M9 demo (Dusko): Running late\; Stage 2 close and release
DESCRIPTION:Deliverable: Pick 5\, 10\, 15 or 30 minutes\; a ready message i
 n your language with the title and new time\; sent from your phone through
  the share sheet\; the meeting moves only if you confirm. Feature freeze\,
  the full device test guide on both platforms\, fixes\, store builds\, rel
 ease notes EN and ES\, Android staged rollout\, iOS submission.\nAcceptanc
 e: The Stage 2 checklist recorded line by line\; your written Stage 2 acce
 ptance.\nPayment: USD 550\, Payment 9\nDependencies: M6 to M8. Francisco: 
 Stage 2 acceptance by November 30.
CATEGORIES:MeetingGuard\,Milestone\,Dusko
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
