DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261201
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261202
SUMMARY:MG M10 demo (Dusko): Summaries arrive by themselves
DESCRIPTION:Deliverable: A private forwarding address for the summary your 
 notetaker already writes\; matched to the meeting by time and title\; unma
 tched ones wait in a summary inbox\; checks that keep a fake summary out o
 f your account\; stored for you only\, encrypted\, deletable.\nAcceptance:
  A real recap email forwarded in lands against the correct meeting\; a for
 ged one is refused.\nPayment: USD 550\, Summaries addition\, part 1\nDepen
 dencies: Francisco: one real notetaker summary email by November 24.
CATEGORIES:MeetingGuard\,Milestone\,Dusko
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
