SUMMARY:MG M11 demo (Dusko): Summaries become commitments
DESCRIPTION:Deliverable: The app reads the summary and proposes what was pr
 omised\, by whom and by when\, with the source sentence\; review screen (a
 ccept all\, edit\, drop) turns accepted items into tasks with alarms linke
 d to the meeting\; the same on WhatsApp for linked users\; every item labe
 lled with its origin\; connect and disconnect screen\; retention rules.\nA
 cceptance: A real recap becoming tasks with alarms\, in the app and on Wha
 tsApp.\nPayment: USD 550\, Summaries addition\, part 2\nDependencies: M10.
CATEGORIES:MeetingGuard\,Milestone\,Dusko
