 u are notified\; only a proposal you approve changes the meeting and re-re
 conciles alarms and synced calendars (the guest page is served from the we
 b agenda\, Sven S6). The complete device test guide in all five languages 
 on both platforms\, accessibility and performance checks\, the final store
  submission\, the handover document.\nAcceptance: A guest responding from 
 a phone browser and the organiser seeing it in the app\; the Stage 4 check
 list recorded\; your written final acceptance.\nPayment: USD 700\, Final a
 cceptance\nDependencies: M6 to M14\; S6. Francisco: final acceptance by De
 cember 25.
CATEGORIES:MeetingGuard\,Milestone\,Dusko
